  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "Stock Tokens are tokenised debt securities issued by Robinhood Assets (Jersey) Limited. They give economic exposure to the underlying share or ETF but no legal or beneficial rights in it, or against its issuer — no voting rights, no shareholder status.",
    "href": "https://docs.robinhood.com/rhj/product/"
   },
   {
    "text": "Robinhood's FAQ says every Stock Token in circulation is backed 1:1 by the underlying, held by its US-based custody partner.",
    "href": "https://docs.robinhood.com/rhj/faq/"
   },
   {
    "text": "Robinhood's service-providers page names Alpaca Securities LLC as the broker and custodian.",
    "href": "https://docs.robinhood.com/rhj/service-providers/"
   },
   {
    "text": "Holders can sell on the secondary market, or redeem directly with the issuer where no authorised participant does it for them, after completing the issuer's KYC/AML checks.",
    "href": "https://docs.robinhood.com/rhj/faq/"
   },
   {
    "text": "Robinhood's product page lists no fee to subscribe, none to redeem in the first 90 days from issuance, and 0.05% to redeem after that.",
    "href": "https://docs.robinhood.com/rhj/product/"
   },
   {
    "text": "Not offered to US persons, and restricted in other places, including Canada, the United Kingdom and Switzerland; Robinhood lists the prohibited jurisdictions.",
    "href": "https://docs.robinhood.com/rhj/restricted-jurisdictions/"
   },
   {
    "text": "Dividends are not paid out: they raise the token's multiplier, so one token comes to stand for more than one share.",
    "href": "https://docs.robinhood.com/rhj/faq/"
   },
   {
    "text": "Robinhood publishes the Base Prospectus and Final Terms; the Liechtenstein Financial Market Authority approved the Base Prospectus, which Robinhood notes is not an endorsement.",
    "href": "https://docs.robinhood.com/rhj"
   },
   {
    "text": "Robinhood lists its Stock Tokens at docs.robinhood.com/chain/contracts — a token with the same ticker at another address is not one.",
    "href": "https://docs.robinhood.com/chain/contracts/"
   }
  ],
